    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRESENTATION</h2><br>This is a classic old-school 2D fantasy RPG.<br><br>In a place far away, Anya lives with her father Caledon. They are both alone and isolated in a small island to the south of the continent. After the catastrophe that almost decimated humanity, they can only rely on each other to survive.<br><br>Caledon's role is to prepare Anya to fend for herself in a world that is very far from hospitable. Their relative peace is altered the day a Druid comes to visit them... Everything Anya once believed will be shattered, and ready or not, she will have to take on the world outside of her island.<br><br>Embark on a journey of self-discovery, love, friendship and purpose in A Place Far Away.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A compelling storyline designed to keep one engaged from start to finish<br></li><li>Cinematic cutscenes that elevates the game's storytelling to higher levels of immersion<br></li><li>Many locations to explore, from snowy islands, to desertic mountains, to forests, ruins and dungeons<br></li><li>Ultimate weapons to be found<br></li><li>Optional boss to find and defeat<br></li><li>Mouse Support<br></li><li>Quest Journal</li></ul>",
